        "original_id": "7002fae2-0874-5a10-846d-46e29e53726d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kool Kojak, Sean Paul, Yelle, Waka Flocka Flame, Travis Barker, Britney Spears, Jesse y Joy, Andy Milonakis, Icona Pop, Danny DeVito, Ed Helms, Zac Efron, Savan Kotecha, Victoria Justice, Warren G\n- Works: Dr. Seuss's The Lorax, The Lorax, Best Friend's Brother, Victorious\n- Organizations: Nickelodeon\n\nFacts:\n- Kool Kojak has written and produced for artists including Sean Paul, Yelle, Waka Flocka Flame, Travis Barker, Britney Spears, Jesse y Joy, Andy Milonakis, Icona Pop, N.A.S.A., Dirt Nasty, Lordz of Brooklyn, Ursula 1000, and Warren G.\n- Kool Kojak has also written and produced for Dr. Seuss's The Lorax.\n- In 2011, \"Best Friend's Brother\" was produced by Kool Kojak.\n- In 2011, Kool Kojak co-wrote \"Best Friend's Brother\" with Savan Kotecha and Victoria Justice for the soundtrack to the Nickelodeon television series \"Victorious\".\n- The film The Lorax includes Danny DeVito as the Lorax, Ed Helms as the Once-ler, and Zac Efron as Ted.",
